          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Corpse Party: Sweet Sachiko's Hysteric Birthday Bash is a different type of adventure in the Corpse Party series that stars the violent and murderous Sachiko Shinozaki, who has decided to invite her victims to Heavenly Host Elementary School to celebrate her birthday. However, this isn’t the type of party where the guests leave with a smile on their faces. Instead, Sachiko plans to force the students to participate in twisted games for her amusement. Will the students survive Sachiko’s celebration, or will they meet a Wrong End once again?",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Corpse Party: Sweet Sachiko's Hysteric Birthday Bash es un tipo de aventura diferente dentro de la serie Corpse Party, protagonizada por la violenta y asesina Sachiko Shinozaki, que ha decidido invitar a sus víctimas a la escuela primaria Heavenly Host para celebrar su cumpleaños. Sin embargo, no es el tipo de fiesta en la que los invitados se van con una sonrisa. En cambio, Sachiko planea obligar a los estudiantes a participar en juegos retorcidos para su diversión. ¿Sobrevivirán los estudiantes a la celebración de Sachiko, o volverán a encontrar un Wrong End?",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
